version: 1.0.0
description: Rust entry point and native plugin registration
components:
  tauri-core:
    description: Tauri entry point. Registers opener/dialog/notification plugins; enables the asset protocol; builds a menu-bar tray and hides the window on close so the scheduler keeps running. Exposes schedule_wake/cancel_wake commands that run pmset (via osascript admin prompt) to wake the Mac from sleep for alarms.
    type: core
    file: src-tauri/src/lib.rs
